cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "reneuro: A European Energy System Model"
abstract: >-
  A European energy system model built on energyRt, developed as teaching
  material for a modelling training course. It reproduces PyPSA-Eur at several
  spatial resolutions, importing pre-built networks, translating them into
  energyRt model objects, and solving them through alternative back ends.
type: software
